+    // TOON-PATCH 0001 hunk 4/6 — WebGPU handle adoption + export on `Device`.
+    // WHY / REMOVE WHEN: see `toon-fabric` in this crate's Cargo.toml.
+    // UPSTREAM: `as_webgpu` and `create_texture_from_webgpu_handle` are
